   1               
   2               /  DDT DRIVER (DR1025)
   3               
   4               / DDT - PDP8-DISC SYSTEM
   5               /
   6               / DDT USES CORE FROM LOC THRU LOC+377 (2 PAGES)
   7               /
   8               /   INITIALLY IT ALSO USES 172-177,LOC-1200 THRU LOC+377
   9               /   TO PREPARE THE DRIVER FOR USE.
  10               /
  11               / DDT OVERLAYS CORE FROM 200-4577 AND
  12               / USES CELLS 3,4,5.  THE DRIVER MAY BE ANYWHERE ABOVE
  13               / 5777 AND IS SET BY SELECTING A VALUE FOR "LOC".
  14               
  15               /THIS IS THE METHOD:
  16               /
  17               /1) LOAD DDT  PROPER AS FOLLOWS:
  18               / .LOAD
  19               / :IN-R:
  20               / ^
  21               / *OPT-1
  22               / *ST=7600
  23               / ^^
  24               /  .SAVE DDT:200-4577;0
  25               /
  26               /2) SAVE A BLOCK OF CELLS THE SAME LENGTH AS DDT PROPER AS:
  27               /
  28               /  .SAVE USER:200-4577;0
  29               /
  30               /3) LOAD IN DDT DRIVER AND START AT LOC-200 AS:
  31               /
  32               / .LOAD
  33               / *R:
  34               / ^
  35               / *OPT-2
  36               / ST=<LOC-200>
  37               / ^^
  38               / *IN-S:DDT,S:USER
  39               / ^
  40               / ^
  41               / .
  42               /
  43               /4) SAVE DDT DRIVER AS A SYSTEM PROGRAM:
  44               /
  45               / .SAVE DDT!<LOC>-<LOC+377>;<LOC>
  46               / .
  47               
  48               
  49               / ERRORS ARE SHOWN BY "DDT?"
  50               
  51               / THE FOLLOWING THINGS MAY CAUSE ERRORS:
  52               /       1. USER FILE TOO LARGE
  53               /       2. SYSTEM DEVICE READ ERROR
  54               /       3. NO COMMAND DECODER
  55               
